{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_title", "source_sha256": "f72a35e7ba6b2aef278c9253351b5a46862af616a20ab4e10e78996a020ea357", "ja": "最後までKAWAII！", "zh": "可爱到最后一刻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1488ddea0956093628e490ac0ff021705975f340abe2b5af95e4b726988c69a0", "ja": "打ち上げでデザートビュッフェにやって来た\nアイドル達。合同イベントを振り返りながら\n思い思いの方法で楽しんでいる。事務所の\n垣根を越えて、仲が深まったアイドル達を\n微笑ましく見守るプロデューサーだった。", "zh": "庆功宴上，偶像们来到了甜点自助餐厅。\n她们一边回顾联合活动，一边用各自的方式享受着。\n制作人欣慰地守望着这些跨越事务所界限、加深了感情的偶像们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "20174b17c7feb2856a4aceb8f85ab6d510265103e17c2e792a28127ecdf7aa98", "ja": "よし、ここだ。\nえーっと……全員いるよな？", "zh": "好，这里就是。\n呃……人都到齐了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "f4e5f2a04324ac96adddba69a63514522b8bc57177377fdd87e829eee7fb1e36", "ja": "あれ？　{$P$}、未来がいないぞ？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}，未来不在这里哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "eb52702e24de3b19e3e5f58c9e2bac53a9f3abfd701246ebe72fe7b80b17baa9", "ja": "なんだって！？", "zh": "什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "434679240c1016b08c7dded69f7276bd638dbbc55d3e445f36d9d4d2d7997c52", "ja": "未来、いたわよ。", "zh": "未来，我看到她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "2e28a30341be0a65920169529e02534683d983a91d1cddf0703e373fffede078", "ja": "ごめんなさーい、\nちょっと隣の小物屋さんに吸い込まれて～。", "zh": "对不起——\n刚才一不小心被旁边的小饰品店吸引过去了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "51bb952f977946a42ee83f5e883bef92a9b2c776e2ca327e09a62dbd459e11fe", "ja": "よかった……。\nそれじゃ改めて、打ち上げを始めようか！", "zh": "太好了……那我们重新开始庆功宴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "7895c3ed4c6561813ba4ff207f245d2d016a6f42169a876bd49efec7ee304229", "ja": "大丈夫、詩花ちゃん。荷物は私が見てるから、\nケーキ取りに行っていいよ。", "zh": "没事的，诗花。行李有我看着呢，\n你去拿蛋糕就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1007_201xxx", "source_sha256": "5a52c086071106cff271ab4d2f5a2ddf9fa06ad40f8b207dade19adb47c52afd", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　みんなでこういうところに\n来るのって、私、初めてで……ドキドキします♪", "zh": "谢谢大家！我还是第一次和大家一起来这种地方……心里好激动♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "382c871e7964d6ad8b9dcd0808fac527f5f8d7df274c522370d8e8dd63287f2b", "ja": "じゃあ、デザートビュッフェのコツを教えてあげる！\nつい甘いものに目が行っちゃうけど……。", "zh": "那我来告诉你吃自助甜点的诀窍吧！\n虽然总是不知不觉就被甜食吸引了注意力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "fe77da7ddb17b935015b5ed75e3125f3f3f70b3aa5eedc79e699bd54b408519e", "ja": "ローストビーフとかサンドイッチとか、しょっぱい系が\n絶対欲しくなるから。先に取っておくこと！", "zh": "因为烤牛肉、三明治之类的咸味食物，绝对会想吃的。所以要先拿好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "bb6c2703782ac890ea5630e0191e1f6c595298fd6e7fdf9b162d2085a6514277", "ja": "あ、私2周目に行くから、詩花さん一緒に取りに\nいきませんか？　おすすめのケーキ教えます♪", "zh": "啊，我要去第2轮，诗花小姐要不要一起去拿？我告诉你推荐的蛋糕♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "3d88fc0889c13f38c709a414f64e29e94f1d2c6b34e9ec9614a62585091d9fab", "ja": "未来ちゃん早ーい！　琴葉ちゃんも、私が荷物番変わる\nから、取りに行ってきたら？　アイスもあったよ～♪", "zh": "未来，你真快！琴叶也去拿吧，我来替你看行李。还有冰淇淋哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "5fcfedbd21f212f1cac095c360fa5e2b6c891f834841d0038dfb85ed749eed2e", "ja": "あ……うん、ありがとう！", "zh": "啊……嗯，谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1f79a240bc6d6fb7ea1a75f50011402388170b1a357455f79737732c3fc76a8d", "ja": "さて、宴もたけなわだけど……。\n琴葉、この辺りであいさつでもしておくか？", "zh": "好了，宴会正热闹着呢……琴叶，要不要在这时候说几句？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "aa6f0d47016f1068e52b3fd6012d2723571600658e7d8e49dbb4511a3a294645", "ja": "えっ！？　あっ、そうですよね。リーダーとして……\nでもどうしよう。何も用意してなくて……。", "zh": "诶！？啊，也对呢。作为队长……\n可是怎么办才好，我什么都没准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "68dbc5bb79148728f0f770bab99594d7daf0aa870eea554eeab9c6a207dcbe3b", "ja": "そんなに堅苦しくなくていいんじゃないかな？\n今の琴葉ちゃんの気持ち、そのままで。", "zh": "不用那么拘谨吧？\n就保持琴叶现在的心情，原原本本地表达出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "94037d7073bb19464a3a3cebb1ed9d91bc5b90553a4dca6ac77a15ef727f592b", "ja": "そ、そっか。そうだよね……。\nそれじゃあ……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。你说得对……  \n那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "1b991d492131716ea514084916ba9937d09f7927da35da062b302a4e4ee216bc", "ja": "今回、私はステージのリーダーを任せていただいて……\n不安も上手くできないこともたくさんあったのですが。", "zh": "这次，大家把舞台领队的重任交给了我……\n虽然我有很多不安，也有很多做不好的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "067345857163d53026032ca6420bebf575a5931c320c1791b133f192017dc4ee", "ja": "真ちゃんや春香ちゃん、そして皆さん全員の力で、\n私たちの『カワイイ』を届けることができました。", "zh": "多亏了真、春香，还有大家所有人的力量，我们才能将我们的『可爱』传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "eaffa90f707f1c1325f3d12e299674aee40d416275df15aa06d823cb70f0e8f4", "ja": "プロモーション番組での衣装でトラブった件は、\nその場にいられなくて申し訳なかった……。", "zh": "关于宣传节目的服装出了问题那件事，我没能在现场，真的很抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "55b04283a1f22cba454478a3f1ffcbed3058c4b4286264e5a40b52035507332c", "ja": "そうそう、琴葉が悪者にされちゃったんですから。\nもっとボクたちと一緒にいてくださいねっ♪", "zh": "对对，琴叶还被当成坏人了呢。\n以后请多和我们待在一起哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "d84ef592cd66c182787684933d60d729ab5549dc032ec8a6f7bf41a12ba7afa4", "ja": "{$P$}のせいじゃないです。\n何事もなければ、簡単な撮影だったはずなので。", "zh": "这不是{$P$}的错。\n要是没发生什么事的话，本该是次轻松的拍摄的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "13b4c081c9ae63292392a793d1da3589c353b3a903a12f9778765e9d8dd8d5b6", "ja": "でも本当に、私一人だったら迷ってしまいそうな時も、\nみんながいてくれて……本当に心強かったです。", "zh": "不过说真的，有时候要是只有我一个人，可能会不知所措，但有大家陪着我……真的让我安心了许多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "5836859058c8eb9b246ab1c0fe3e448529488502014ef004d325d764b82bec67", "ja": "真ちゃん、春香ちゃん、伊織ちゃん、響ちゃん、\n詩花ちゃん、未来……。", "zh": "真，你、春香、伊织、响，\n诗花、未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "76a47a06545b1106447fe07de5af275d42788f408cd7457e8d0e830f417b3c42", "ja": "そして、私を信頼して任せてくれた、\n{$P$}。ありがとうございました！", "zh": "还有，谢谢愿意信任我、把一切交给我的{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "1a74d6c7f0a74ace20a86960321e136019b3a2ca0f2061d151ea94799443a577", "ja": "自分のこと、ちゃんとカワイイって\n思えるようになったの？", "zh": "你已经能真正觉得自己很可爱了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "51c102fdd0d663df574deac3a99e79954fe6b9677d5104daf127fffb80857c2c", "ja": "あ……うん。\n前よりは、少しだけ！", "zh": "啊……嗯。\n比以前稍微能觉得自己可爱一点了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "7f52992c3f2326cc4840af8406afe7005868e4838ee4e81f44c5b9f352922b03", "ja": "詩花さん、パンケーキのデコじょうずー！\n真似していいですか？", "zh": "诗花姐，煎饼装饰得好漂亮——！可以学你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1028_201xxx", "source_sha256": "c9f3120d659d381617770ef8f22b31bde72c702d467229865ea3b9b32685181c", "ja": "もちろん！\nでも生クリーム、そんなには使わないけど……？", "zh": "当然可以！\n不过鲜奶油，其实用不了那么多哦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "dc74f780dd27498a8a1255d5890f800c1ab19e80f79d27822f9ab55d817eab40", "ja": "うう、もうお腹いっぱいになっちゃったぞ……さっき\n品切れだったモンブラン、まだ食べてないのに～。", "zh": "呜呜，已经吃饱了啦……明明刚才\n还没吃到卖光了的蒙布朗呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "f4cce83c77c60ee3677a6b1aa6db53a2c203ea52222e00aa6998f0015fc3328a", "ja": "えっ、そうなんだ……。\nあのモンブラン、本当においしかった……よ？", "zh": "诶，是这样啊……。那份蒙布朗，真的很好吃……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "5215d3c2e3ec5f01cd1d1a6a9432e7dcedabf9d926f944f86db7ba9698e13a58", "ja": "うぎゃ～っ！　やっぱりそうだよね！？\nうう……自分、ちょっとお店の周り走ってくる！！", "zh": "呜哇～！果然是这样对吧！？\n呜呜……我、我去店周围跑一圈！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "14ad66873286ea5182f078fd5d6f82779e5aac273907628a155fc43974e0257c", "ja": "食べてすぐ走って、お腹痛くならないのかしら。\nま、今のうちに確保しておきましょ♪　にひひっ♪", "zh": "刚吃完就跑，不会肚子疼吗？不过，趁现在先把它占下来吧♪ 嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "61aeb26d76fee5a3a6d74793d9dd66d4e0626353582c8d28a2e3a07d040b8538", "ja": "へへーっ！\n取ってきました、5皿目です！", "zh": "嘿嘿——！  \n我拿来了，这是第5盘！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9fb50ee7d716dd08d8fe82b66a1e6d3e7835b9bb1cf52a6ab2e7d375b04ab3a4", "ja": "すごいな……。スイーツは別腹らしいけど、\nそんなに食べられるものなのか？", "zh": "真厉害……。听说甜点是装在另一个胃里的，\n真能吃下那么多吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "85f3f89c0a2e54b69af841907f2f1c99b0bd1da13ad2200375c65cd585a9b592", "ja": "もちろん！　カワイイはお腹が空くんです。\nねっ、琴葉♪", "zh": "当然啦！可爱可是很容易肚子饿的。\n对吧，琴叶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "3431159d944e281dd34ef25e7cd6e135a2c1c5838df3d995560116395ab72662", "ja": "はい、カワイイはいろいろ大変なんです。\n私もおかわり取ってきます！", "zh": "是的，可爱也是很辛苦的。\n我也去拿些饭，再来一份！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "f6d96145b2140a75c05b0559fd7f9c572339b82fc22f4cc902996544d5a4e39b", "ja": "（琴葉もみんなも、いい笑顔だ。事務所の垣根を越えた\n合同イベント、いろいろトラブルもあったけど……）", "zh": "（琴叶和大家都笑得很开心。跨越事务所界限的联合活动，虽然遇到了各种麻烦……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_epi01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "9a60c2b0a22f57c49f9e0d742078a79d12947c01aa2e800ee4f015f935e57b68", "ja": "（イベントもステージも、どうやら大成功！\nカワイイはすべてを解決する……のかもな！）", "zh": "（活动和舞台演出似乎都大获成功！可爱或许真的能解决一切……吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
